# Show age ciphertext as plaintext in local diffs, on machines that hold the key.
#
# This only names the driver. What `age` means is set per clone in .git/config,
# by run_onchange_after_08-source-repo.sh, because git will not take a diff
# command from a committed file. A clone without that setting, GitHub's included,
# shows the ciphertext as before.
*.age diff=age
